WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.400
Safaricom’s operating licence, the launch of M-PESA and the start of share trading were three separate milestones.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.280
1999. Safaricom receives its operating licence.

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:17.160
Mar 2007. Safaricom launches M-PESA in Kenya.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:22.280
9 Jun 2008. Safaricom shares begin trading in Nairobi.

00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:28.960
The full chronology links to company records and follows later changes in products, markets and ownership.
